    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50212" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰθῠ-πτίων</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτῑ],
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ωνος</span>, ὁ,
				ἡ</span>, only in <i><span class="en">
			Il.
			21.169
		</span></i>
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελίην ἰθυπτίωνα Ἁστεροπαίῳ
		ἐφῆκε</span>, from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέτομαι</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>straight-flying</i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰθύς</span> (A) <i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>):—<i><span class="en">
				Zenod.
			</span></i> read <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰθυκτίωνα</span></b> ,
				<i>straight-fibred</i> (fort. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κτείωνα</span>, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐθυκτέανον,
				κτηδών</span>).</div>
